{"seq":4,"slug":"computational-complexity","title":"计算复杂性理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/discrete-mathematics/formal-languages-automata/computational-complexity","wordCount":1067,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"计算复杂性理论\">计算复杂性理论</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>计算复杂性理论研究的不是&quot;问题能否被解决&quot;，而是&quot;解决问题需要多少资源&quot;。资源通常指时间（计算步数）和空间（存储量）。复杂性理论将可判定问题按照所需资源的量级分为不同的复杂性类，最核心的问题是 P 与 NP 是否相等——这是计算机科学乃至整个数学中最重要的未解决问题之一。</p>\n<p>复杂性理论对软件工程的直接影响是：了解问题的固有难度，避免在 NP 难问题上寻找多项式精确算法，转而使用近似算法或启发式方法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[计算复杂性] --&gt; B[时间复杂性]&#10;    A --&gt; C[空间复杂性]&#10;    B --&gt; D[P 类]&#10;    B --&gt; E[NP 类]&#10;    B --&gt; F[EXPTIME]&#10;    E --&gt; G[NP 完全]&#10;    E --&gt; H[NP 困难]&#10;    C --&gt; I[L 类]&#10;    C --&gt; J[PSPACE]\">graph TD\n    A[计算复杂性] --&gt; B[时间复杂性]\n    A --&gt; C[空间复杂性]\n    B --&gt; D[P 类]\n    B --&gt; E[NP 类]\n    B --&gt; F[EXPTIME]\n    E --&gt; G[NP 完全]\n    E --&gt; H[NP 困难]\n    C --&gt; I[L 类]\n    C --&gt; J[PSPACE]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>复杂性类</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>包含关系</th>\n<th>典型问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P</td>\n<td>确定性多项式时间</td>\n<td>P ⊆ NP</td>\n<td>排序、最短路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NP</td>\n<td>非确定性多项式时间</td>\n<td>NP ⊆ PSPACE</td>\n<td>SAT、旅行商判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>co-NP</td>\n<td>补问题在 NP</td>\n<td>P ⊆ co-NP</td>\n<td>重言式判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NP-complete</td>\n<td>NP 中最难的</td>\n<td>NPC ⊆ NP</td>\n<td>3-SAT、图着色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NP-hard</td>\n<td>至少和 NPC 一样难</td>\n<td>NPC ⊆ NPH</td>\n<td>旅行商优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PSPACE</td>\n<td>多项式空间</td>\n<td>NP ⊆ PSPACE</td>\n<td>QBF、广义棋</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXPTIME</td>\n<td>指数时间</td>\n<td>PSPACE ⊆ EXPTIME</td>\n<td>通用问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"p-类与-np-类\">P 类与 NP 类</h2><p><strong>P 类</strong>：存在确定性图灵机在多项式时间内判定的语言。P 类问题被认为是&quot;高效可解的&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>NP 类</strong>：存在非确定性图灵机在多项式时间内判定的语言。等价定义：给定一个&quot;证书&quot;（certificate），可以在多项式时间内验证答案的正确性。</p>\n<p><strong>P vs NP 问题</strong>：P 是否等于 NP？若 P = NP，则所有能快速验证的问题也能快速求解。大多数计算机科学家猜测 P ≠ NP。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Decision = boolean;&#10;&#10;interface NPWitness&lt;I, W&gt; {&#10;  instance: I;&#10;  witness: W;&#10;  verify: (instance: I, witness: W) =&gt; Decision;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function demonstrateNPDefinition(): void {&#10;  const satVerifier = (formula: Array&lt;Array&lt;{ var: number; neg: boolean }&gt;&gt;, assignment: boolean[]): boolean =&gt; {&#10;    return formula.every((clause) =&gt; clause.some((lit) =&gt; (lit.neg ? !assignment[lit.var] : assignment[lit.var])));&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  const hamiltonianVerifier = (adj: boolean[][], path: number[]): boolean =&gt; {&#10;    const n = adj.length;&#10;    if (path.length !== n) return false;&#10;    if (new Set(path).size !== n) return false;&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; n - 1; i++) {&#10;      if (!adj[path[i]][path[i + 1]]) return false;&#10;    }&#10;    return adj[path[n - 1]][path[0]];&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  void satVerifier;&#10;  void hamiltonianVerifier;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Decision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NPWitness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">I</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">W</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  instance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> I</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  witness</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> W</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  verify</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">instance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> I</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">witness</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> W</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Decision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> demonstrateNPDefinition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> satVerifier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">formula</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">var</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">neg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }>>, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">assignment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> formula.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">every</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">clause</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clause.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (lit.neg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">assignment[lit.var] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> assignment[lit.var])));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hamiltonianVerifier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">adj</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adj.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (path.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(path).size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">adj[path[i]][path[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> adj[path[n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]][path[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> satVerifier;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hamiltonianVerifier;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;P vs NP 的世界观&quot;&#10;        A[&quot;如果 P ≠ NP&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;NP-complete 不在 P 中&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; C[&quot;密码学安全&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; D[&quot;优化问题固有困难&quot;]&#10;        E[&quot;如果 P = NP&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;所有 NP 问题高效可解&quot;]&#10;        E --&gt; G[&quot;密码学崩溃&quot;]&#10;        E --&gt; H[&quot;优化问题轻松解决&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"P vs NP 的世界观\"\n        A[\"如果 P ≠ NP\"] --&gt; B[\"NP-complete 不在 P 中\"]\n        A --&gt; C[\"密码学安全\"]\n        A --&gt; D[\"优化问题固有困难\"]\n        E[\"如果 P = NP\"] --&gt; F[\"所有 NP 问题高效可解\"]\n        E --&gt; G[\"密码学崩溃\"]\n        E --&gt; H[\"优化问题轻松解决\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"np-完全性\">NP 完全性</h2><p><strong>NP 完全</strong>（NP-Complete）问题是 NP 中&quot;最难&quot;的问题。一个问题 L 是 NP 完全的，当且仅当：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>L ∈ NP</li>\n<li>对 NP 中的每个问题 A，A 可以多项式时间归约到 L</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Cook-Levin 定理</strong>（1971）：SAT（布尔可满足性）是 NP 完全的。这是第一个被证明 NP 完全的问题，之后通过归约链建立了大量 NP 完全问题。</p>\n<p>常见 NP 完全问题及归约链：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface NPCReduction {&#10;  from: string;&#10;  to: string;&#10;  preserves: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const classicReductions: NPCReduction[] = [&#10;  { from: &#39;SAT&#39;, to: &#39;3-SAT&#39;, preserves: &#39;限制子句长度&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;3-SAT&#39;, to: &#39;CLIQUE&#39;, preserves: &#39;子句→小团&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;3-SAT&#39;, to: &#39;VERTEX-COVER&#39;, preserves: &#39;否定+覆盖&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;3-SAT&#39;, to: &#39;3-COLORING&#39;, preserves: &#39;小部件构造&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;VERTEX-COVER&#39;, to: &#39;SET-COVER&#39;, preserves: &#39;一般化&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;3-SAT&#39;, to: &#39;HAMILTONIAN-PATH&#39;, preserves: &#39;路径编码赋值&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;HAMILTONIAN-PATH&#39;, to: &#39;TSP&#39;, preserves: &#39;加权图&#39; },&#10;  { from: &#39;3-SAT&#39;, to: &#39;SUBSET-SUM&#39;, preserves: &#39;数值编码&#39; },&#10;];&#10;&#10;function polynomialReduction&lt;A, B&gt;(transformInput: (a: A) =&gt; B, solveB: (b: B) =&gt; boolean): (a: A) =&gt; boolean {&#10;  return (a: A) =&gt; solveB(transformInput(a));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NPCReduction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  preserves</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><sp